    "notes": [
      "Liberty tariff totals include distribution, ECAC generation/offset/balancing, GHG, PPP, GRCMA, BRRBA, and MARBA charges shown in the tariff tables (AL 298-E / 298-E-A, effective September 1, 2026). The separately listed $0.00130/kWh CPUC and Energy Commission surcharges are excluded, matching prior releases.",
      "The app stores the ECAC Generation, ECAC Offset, and ECAC Balancing columns in generation and all other tariff columns in delivery so combined equals the published total usage charge.",
      "Customer charges are recorded in fixedCharges metadata and are not included in EV charging session estimates.",
      "TOU periods are approximated to whole-hour boundaries used by the app: 5:01pm is represented as 5pm, 10:01pm as 10pm, 7:01am as 7am, and 10:01am as 10am."
